WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
More than one career path. Genuine working-app screenshots. This is a captioned screenshot sequence, not continuous footage.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Choose a meaningful quest. Progress records learning actions, never hiring worthiness. Replays do not farm rewards.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Source Detective. Five source-understanding checks must pass. Frozen evidence is not a current eligibility decision.

4
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Build an Accessibility Artifact. Only five predefined exercise conditions are checked. This does not certify WCAG compliance.

5
00:01:45.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Build evidence, not assumptions. The actual Passport retains quest version, source snapshot and unresolved questions. All fields remain editable.

6
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Discover a different next step. Courses are training. Directories are not individual openings. Publisher metadata does not approve qualifications.

7
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Bring a question to a human. Independent participants n=0. Career benefit and return engagement remain unmeasured hypotheses.
